# Labels inside footnotes

A classic footnote[^a], an inline one[fn: Inline, labelled @label[fn-inline] here.],
a labelled inline one[^c: Labelled inline, labelled @label[fn-labelled] here.], and
the classic footnote cited a second time[^a].

References: classic @ref[fn-classic], inline @ref[fn-inline], typed
@cref[fn-labelled] and @Cref[fn-classic].

[^a]: Classic, labelled @label[fn-classic] here.
